Hi <%= @user.display_name %>,

<% if @user_breaths.positive? %>
You breathed <%= @user_breaths %> time<%= @user_breaths == 1 ? "" : "s" %> this week.<% if @streak.positive? %> You're on a <%= @streak %>-day streak.<% end %>
